{% include '_header.html.liquid', emailTitle: "We temporarily locked password and TOTP login to your account" %}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">{{ appName }} detected {{ attemptCount }} failed attempts within a {{ windowMinutes }} min window and temporarily blocked further password and TOTP login attempts to your account.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;margin:0 0 20px;background:#fbeaea;border:1px solid #f3caca;border-radius:8px">
  <tr><td style="padding:16px;font-size:14px;color:#7a1f1f">
    <p style="margin:0 0 6px"><strong>Failed attempts:</strong> {{ attemptCount }}</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 6px"><strong>Time window:</strong> {{ windowMinutes }} min</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 6px"><strong>Source IP addresses:</strong> {{ ipAddresses }}</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 6px"><strong>Blocked at:</strong> {{ occurredAt }}</p>
    <p style="margin:0"><strong>Block expires:</strong> {{ lockedUntil }}</p>
  </td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">The restriction applies to password and TOTP login attempts for your account regardless of the source IP address.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">If you recognize this activity, no action is needed. If you do not, open {{ appName }} directly and review the Audit Log. Also make sure your password is unique and TOTP is enabled.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#8a8a8a">This alert does not contain an unlock link. The block expires automatically at the time shown above.</p>
{% include '_footer.en.html.liquid' %}
